  "updated_at": "2026-04-16",
  "bio": "Sven is a masterful tattoo artist based in Göttingen, Germany, who specializes in black and gray realism that beautifully captures the essence of his subjects. His professionalism is evident in both his meticulous attention to detail and his dedicated work ethic, ensuring every piece is a true work of art. Discover more of Sven's exceptional portfolio by visiting Unleashed Art Tattoo on Facebook.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Göttingen, Lower-saxony, Germany"
}